// Script Variable PopUpMessageHeroes :
"P1225336235" "<span align=center><scale 1.5><font face=title><color orange>Architect Entertainment</color></font></scale></span><br><br>Welcome to Architect Entertainment. Here you are able to create and play missions created by other heroes and even villains throughout Paragon City and the Rogue Isles.<br><br>To begin, simply find an arc computer located conveniently throughout the building. If you have any questions please speak with the Architect Trainer.<br><br>We hope you enjoy your adventure."
