"P1052759985" "<span align=center><scale 1.5><font face=title><color orange>Architect Entertainment</color></font></scale></span><br><br>Welcome to Architect Entertainment. Here you are able to create and play missions created by other villains and even heroes throughout the Rogue Isles and Paragon City<br><br>To begin, simply find an arc computer located conveniently throughout the building. If you have any questions please speak with the Architect Trainer.<br><br>We hope you enjoy your adventure."
